# TEMPLATE CONFIGURATION

> **Phase 1 Reference** - Template-first approach

---

## TEMPLATE LOCATION

```
r-genie/05_ReadMe_Agent/
├── templates/
│   ├── readme-style.yaml        # Structure and style configuration
│   └── readme-template-guide.md # Content guide: what goes where
└── examples/
    └── *.md                      # Example formats to match
```

---

## PRE-GENERATION CHECKLIST (MANDATORY)

Before generating ANY content:

- [ ] `templates/readme-style.yaml` read (structure and inclusion rules)
- [ ] `templates/readme-template-guide.md` read (content guidance)
- [ ] `examples/` folder read (all .md files for formatting reference)
- [ ] Matching example selected for project type
- [ ] Sections identified per template structure
- [ ] Diagram placements identified per template guide
- [ ] Mermaid diagrams planned (NOT ASCII)

**If ANY check fails → DO NOT PROCEED → Fix first**

---

## TEMPLATE STRUCTURE

```yaml
# readme-style.yaml
structure:
  sections:
    - name: "Overview"
      include: true
    - name: "Architecture"
      include: true
    # ... more sections

style:
  include_diagram: true      # Mermaid required
  include_badges: true       # Version badges
  include_toc: true          # Table of contents
  include_attribution: true  # R-GENIE footer
```

---

## EXAMPLE SELECTION

| Project Type | Matching Example |
|--------------|------------------|
| API/REST | `01_api_project_readme.md` |
| Batch/Scheduled | `02_batch_project_readme.md` |
| Event-driven | Closest match + adaptations |

---

## TEMPLATE-DRIVEN RULES

### Main Document
- Generate sections where `structure.sections[].include: true`
- Match example formatting EXACTLY

### Mermaid Requirements
- At least **2 Mermaid diagrams** per README
- `flowchart TB` for system design
- `flowchart TD` for process flows
- **NO ASCII art** - use Mermaid only

---

## PHASE 1 OUTPUT

```
📋 Template Configuration Loaded:
   ✅ Style: [Custom | Default]
   ✅ Sections: [X sections]
   ✅ Diagrams: Mermaid required
   ✅ Example: [selected file]
```

---

## NO CONFIGURATION?

If templates unconfigured or empty:
- Use default R-GENIE style
- 7 standard sections
- 2 Mermaid diagrams
- Dynamic badges
- R-GENIE attribution footer
